  "Package": "receptLoss",
  "Type": "Package",
  "Title": "Unsupervised Identification of Genes with Expression Loss in\nSubsets of Tumors",
  "Version": "1.22.0",
  "Author": "Daniel Pique, John Greally, Jessica Mar",
  "Maintainer": "Daniel Pique <daniel.pique@med.einstein.yu.edu>",
  "Description": "receptLoss identifies genes whose expression is lost in\nsubsets of tumors relative to normal tissue. It is particularly\nwell-suited in cases where the number of normal tissue samples\nis small, as the distribution of gene expression in normal\ntissue samples is approximated by a Gaussian. Originally\ndesigned for identifying nuclear hormone receptor expression\nloss but can be applied transcriptome wide as well.",
